WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.480
Seigi.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.860
It's been a while. It's Dad.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.030
How did you find me?

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:16.610
You've grown so much, Seigi.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.410
The last time I saw you, 
you were still in grade school.

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:23.870
Why are you glaring at 
your dad like that, Seigi?

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.350
Oh, I get it.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:33.810
Your mother's turned you against 
me by bad-mouthing me.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:35.690
You must've had a rough time.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.220
Are you sorry?

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.430
For what?

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.830
For hitting Hiromi.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.530
She's the one who hit me.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.520
It really hurt, you know.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.230
That's because <i>you</i> hit <i>her</i>!

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.860
That doesn't make it okay to hit someone.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:00.660
It's clear to me now. 
You're not sorry at all.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:03.580
Now that she and I are divorced, 
we have nothing to do with each other.

00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:09.540
From now on, you and I should 
live together as father and son.

00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:13.080
I thought we had nothing 
to do with each other now.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.440
Children can't cut ties with their parents.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:18.050
Half of you came from me, you know.

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.510
You're not my father anymore!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:03.040
<u>Episode 12</u>
<b>Tanzanite of Rebirth</b>

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.500
Hello, Hiromi?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.820
<i>Seigi? Why are you calling so late?</i>

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:18.380
Well... I was just wondering if anything 
out of the ordinary has happened recently.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.140
<i>Out of the ordinary?</i>

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:23.850
<i>Oh, that's right!
Your dad's coming back next week.</i>

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.360
<i>You should see him.</i>

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.740
So Nakata-san's coming back, huh?

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.410
<i>Don't call him "Nakata-san." 
He's your dad, you know.</i>

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.880
I know. Bye.

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:50.420
I won't be able to come to work tomorrow.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:53.480
I won't be able to come to work tomorrow.
I'm sorry.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.210
I won't be able to come to work tomorrow.
I'm sorry.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.400
Understood. Is something wrong?

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.400
Richard

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.400
Message

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.970
Understood.
Is something wrong?

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.970
I won't be able to come to work tomorrow.
I'm sorry.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.970
Richard

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.450
Understood. Is something wrong?

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:10.450
Something suddenly came up, 
and I'm going to visit my parents.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:11.430
Something suddenly came up, 
and I'm going to visit my parents.

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:21.820
You're sure yawning a lot.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.070
I didn't get much sleep.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.450
Bragging about how much 
you've been studying, are you?

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.370
Studying, huh?

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.410
Come to think of it, 
exams are coming up soon...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:42.860
Sorry. I just remembered 
I have something to do.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.380
What?

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.930
Hey, Nakata! I'm gonna eat your food!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.940
Nakata-sama

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.650
Shimeno Hisashi?

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:01.290
<i>Yeah. He said he wanted the key.</i>

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:03.240
Nakata-sama

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:03.240
From Your Landlord

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:03.250
<i>Claimed he was your father.</i>

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.910
He's not my father.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:08.590
Also, please don't tell 
my mother about this.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:12.760
<i>Sure, but shouldn't you go to the police?</i>

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:15.360
I'll be fine. Thank you.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.490
<i>Can we chat?</i>

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.490
<i>Richard</i>

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.490
<i>Missing</i>

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.490
<i>Just Now</i>

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.600
<i>Can we chat?</i>

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.600
<i>\hSomething suddenly came up, 
and I'm going to visit my parents.</i>

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.600
Richard...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.100
<i>Can we chat?</i>

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:37.100
<i>\hSomething suddenly came up, 
and I'm going to visit my parents.</i>

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.100
<i>The truth is</i>

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.130
<i>The truth is</i>

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:41.380
<i>The truth</i>

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:41.630
<i>The</i>

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.360
Seigi-kun.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:50.290
Seigi-kun?

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:51.370
Seigi-kun!

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:53.990
Oh, Tanimoto-san.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:56.660
You finally noticed me! Lots on your mind?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.040
Yeah, kinda. Sorry.

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:05.360
What's wrong?

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.590
Wait!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.870
Did something happen? You don't look well.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.010
Hey, Seigi-kun...

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:13.600
Shut—

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.560
<i>Shut up! Out of my way!</i>

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.820
Seigi-kun, are you okay?

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:28.570
Sorry.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:41.130
Saul-san...

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:42.130
Saul-san

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.070
<i>My apprentice is worried about you.</i>

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:47.630
<i>Is your urgent business at home 
really just urgent business?</i>

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:50.830
<i>Or it is the type of urgent business 
that's difficult to discuss?</i>

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:57.000
<i>I have exams coming up, so I won't be able 
to make it to the store again this week.</i>

00:06:57.500 --> 00:07:00.900
<i>Also, civil servant exam cram 
sessions are starting soon,</i>

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.680
<i>so I'll be focusing on my studies for a while.</i>

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:13.160
I have exams coming up, 
so I won't be able to make it to the store again this week.
 Also, civil servant exam cram sessions are starting soon, 
so I'll be focusing on my studies for a while.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:13.160
I may have to quit my job.

